{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113299","id":3055158738,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62GgXS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113299","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113299.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113299.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113299","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113299/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113299/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113299/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/065920412f75d3dfba344e32e2a0f01986caa803","number":113299,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Support unary '+' in Variant parser","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This adds support for parsing '+' in Variants.\r\n\r\nCurrently, in an exported property, if you type `-1` it correctly assigns `-1`. However, if you assign `+1`, it is rejected as erroneous.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"89\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e4667a6-5a01-4fe1-b931-913676d0e17f\" />\r\n<img width=\"341\" height=\"90\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3102c169-6b05-4d82-9646-42160e3e984c\" />\r\n\r\nI believe that this small change should fix it. Floats are later parsed with [`as_double()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7ed0b6167618f9c8c5df87c7e83da6003c081368/core/string/string_buffer.h#L154) which calls [`String::to_float`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7ed0b6167618f9c8c5df87c7e83da6003c081368/core/string/ustring.cpp#L2574) which calls [`built_in_strtod`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7ed0b6167618f9c8c5df87c7e83da6003c081368/core/string/ustring.cpp#L2352) which [handles `+` signs](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7ed0b6167618f9c8c5df87c7e83da6003c081368/core/string/ustring.cpp#L2424).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_ur